  "body": "* Stunning elevated sea views\r\n* 10-year Master Build Guarantee\r\n* Practical single-level layout\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Prime coastal location\r\n\r\nWelcome to your next chapter in one of Orewa's most sought-after communities. Set on 518m² of freehold land with a 179m² well-designed indoor floor area, this beautifully crafted single-level home features 4 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, delivering the perfect harmony of premium comfort, timeless elegance and unbeatable convenience for modern living.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, you'll appreciate the peace of mind that comes with a brand-new build. Finished with high-end premium quality materials and backed by a reliable 10-year Master Build Guarantee, every thoughtful detail is tailored to bring daily luxury and long-lasting value, making this home both stunning and highly durable for years to come.\r\n\r\nBoasting a spacious, practical single-level layout, this residence is perfectly suited for growing families and working professionals. It offers four generously sized bedrooms, including a private master suite fitted with a spacious walk-in wardrobe. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area serves as the warm heart of the home, featuring modern finishes and seamless indoor-outdoor flow, creating a versatile space for casual relaxation and stylish entertaining.\r\n\r\nA double internal access garage provides secure all-weather parking and abundant storage space, fully meeting your daily storage and parking needs with great convenience.\r\n\r\nTucked in the peaceful enclave of Ara Hills, this prime residence is just minutes away from top local schools, the golden sands of Orewa Beach and the vibrant amenities of the Hibiscus Coast. Easy motorway access ensures effortless daily commutes, keeping you closely connected to all essential facilities and lifestyle hotspots.\r\n\r\nCall Team Vinson and Amy on 022 571 7074 today to arrange your private viewing.\r\nFor more information, please visit: vinsonamyandco.nz",
